                      "reason": "GLP-1RA and comparator medication groups were clearly defined, with named drugs in each class. Intervention status was based on new medication initiation at the index date, before outcome occurrence. No evidence suggests classification was influenced by subsequent nonexudative AMD diagnosis or risk. Lack of dose and treatment-duration details does not substantially threaten initial classification.",
