                      "reason": "Intervention groups were defined as GLP-1RA therapy versus non-GLP-1RA antidiabetic therapy. Classification appears to be based on medication coding around treatment initiation and is unlikely to have been influenced by later exudative conversion, although actual adherence and persistence are not confirmed.",
