                      "reason": "GLP-1RA use was determined by routine clinical treatment rather than random allocation. After matching, the incidence cohort still had higher HbA1c and BMI in the GLP-1RA group. The authors acknowledge possible bias from unidentified covariates and lack of adjustment for socioeconomic factors. Important AMD risk factors and detection-related factors, including smoking and ophthalmic visit patterns, were not clearly controlled in the provided text.",
