                      "reason": "The combined progression endpoint depends on risk of both exudative conversion and advanced nonexudative AMD, which are influenced by baseline AMD severity, retinal imaging findings, smoking, genetics, age, diabetes severity, and eye-care access. Propensity matching was used, but the matched progression cohort retained higher HbA1c and BMI in GLP-1RA users. The authors acknowledge possible nonidentified covariate bias and no socioeconomic adjustment.",
