              "overall_reason": "For incident any AMD, the study defined AMD using ICD-10 codes but the supplied results primarily report subtype-specific nonexudative analyses and tabulated exudative events rather than a clearly reported comparative combined any-AMD effect. As a retrospective non-randomized EHR cohort, the result is vulnerable to substantial confounding by indication and baseline prognosis, post-intervention selection through minimum drug-duration requirements, and imperfect ICD-based outcome ascertainment. The likely direction of bias is unpredictable, although residual confounding and differential outcome misclassification could materially affect estimates."
