              "overall_risk_of_bias": "serious",
              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias was judged serious for incident any AMD. The study used a retrospective, non-randomized TriNetX EHR cohort with propensity score matching, but important residual confounding and selection concerns remain. Exposure and outcome definitions were code-based; adherence and duration of medication use were not assessed; and outcome ascertainment depended on routine clinical diagnosis documentation. These concerns are sufficient to make the result meaningfully vulnerable to bias despite large sample size and matched analyses."
