              "overall_risk_of_bias": "serious",
              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for incident any AMD. The study is a large retrospective, nonrandomized EMR cohort with propensity-score matching, but the GLP-1RA cohort still had higher HbA1c and BMI after matching, and the authors acknowledge possible bias from unidentified covariates and lack of adjustment for socioeconomic factors. Selection on availability of follow-up windows, incomplete information on missingness/adherence, and ICD-code outcome ascertainment further limit causal interpretation. Direction of bias is not reliably predictable."
