              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias was judged serious for incident exudative/neovascular AMD. Although the study used a large EHR network and propensity score matching, the result is vulnerable to residual confounding, post-index selection issues, uncertain long-term medication exposure/adherence, and code-based outcome misclassification. These limitations are especially relevant for a relatively less frequent advanced AMD subtype."
