              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for incident exudative or neovascular AMD. The result comes from a retrospective, nonrandomized, propensity-matched EMR cohort with residual baseline imbalance in HbA1c and BMI and acknowledged unmeasured and socioeconomic confounding. Additional concerns include selection on follow-up availability, unreported treatment adherence/switching, and ICD-code outcome ascertainment without detailed validation or anti-VEGF confirmation in the provided text."
