              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for incident exudative/neovascular AMD. The study used a large retrospective EHR cohort with propensity-score matching and outcome-specific exclusion of prior disease, but the result remains vulnerable to residual confounding by indication and ocular/systemic risk, selection of adherent survivors with 5 years of ophthalmology and medication documentation, and code-based outcome ascertainment without ophthalmic imaging or staging confirmation."
