              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is judged moderate for incident nonexudative AMD. The study used a retrospective active-comparator design with extensive propensity-score matching and prespecified ICD-10-CM outcome coding, and findings were supported by a similar older-age subgroup and null negative controls. Nonetheless, the nonrandomized EHR-based design leaves residual confounding, potential diagnostic-code misclassification or incomplete detection of nonexudative AMD, unknown adherence/switching, and incomplete information on missing follow-up or missing covariate handling."
