              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for incident nonexudative AMD. The retrospective nonrandomized design, residual baseline imbalances after propensity matching, acknowledged unmeasured and socioeconomic confounding, selection on follow-up availability, unreported treatment persistence, and ICD-code outcome ascertainment limit confidence in a causal interpretation."
