              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for incident nonexudative AMD. Propensity matching and exclusion of prior nonexudative AMD strengthen the analysis, but the result is still limited by residual confounding in a non-randomized medication comparison, selection into the cohort based on post-index follow-up and medication documentation, and diagnosis-code outcome measurement without detailed ophthalmic imaging or staging."
