              "overall_risk_of_bias": "serious",
              "overall_reason": "Overall risk of bias is serious for retinopathy/diabetic retinopathy/diabetic macular edema events as an ocular safety or misclassification-related endpoint. The supplied focused text provides limited direct outcome-specific detail for this endpoint, but the same retrospective non-randomized design, six-month post-initiation treatment requirement, differential HbA1c missingness, shorter GLP-1RA follow-up, and routine structured-data ascertainment create important bias concerns. Bias direction is unpredictable because GLP-1RA prescribing, diabetes severity, retinal monitoring, and ocular-event coding may all be related.",
